-- The Visuals tab can change the numbers a placed unit shows. The script's own decisions keep
-- reading the real ones through this.
-- (The real number is kept on the object itself as an attribute. A weak table keyed by the
-- object forgets it at the next garbage collection even while the object is still in the game:
-- measured 4090 entries -> 12 in 8 s. The shown number was then taken for a new server number
-- and scaled again, over and over.)
function AA.rv(object)
	local real = object:GetAttribute("AAReal")
	if real ~= nil and object.Value == object:GetAttribute("AAShown") then
		return real
	end
	return object.Value
end

